---
import Photo from './Photo.astro';
---
<section class="editorial-feature">
  <div class="feature-photo">
    <Photo
      src="project-2-2.jpg"
      alt="Custom cabinetry and kitchen island in Gold Coast Build’s Glenview custom home"
      slot="half"
    />
    <span>GLENVIEW CUSTOM HOME / INTERIOR DETAIL</span>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-story">
    <div class="eyebrow">A closer look at our work</div>
    <h2>More than square feet.<br />A way of living.</h2>
    <p>In this Glenview residence, a generous kitchen opens into the family room, while custom
      cabinetry and quartzite surfaces bring character to the spaces used most.</p>
    <p>A floor-to-ceiling stone fireplace anchors the gathering space. Upstairs, a marble
      primary bath and walk-in steam shower create a quieter retreat. Each part of the home
      contributes to the whole.</p>
    <div class="feature-facts">
      <div><strong>5</strong><span>Bedrooms</span></div>
      <div><strong>4.5</strong><span>Bathrooms</span></div>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/projects/luxurious-new-home-construction-in-glenview-il/">
      Explore the residence <span>↗</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
